                "name": "Deserialization of Untrusted Data"
            },
            "notes": [
                {
                    "category": "summary",
                    "text": "NVIDIA Megatron-LM contains a vulnerability in checkpoint loading where an attacker could cause deserialization of untrusted data. A successful exploit of this vulnerability might lead to code execution, information disclosure, and data tampering.",
                    "title": "Vulnerability description"
                },
